  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Incentive Fund Phase V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Incentive Fund is a competitive grants program under the PNG-Australia Partnership. The Fund provides high-performing PNG organisations with grants to improve service delivery and to provide economic opportunities through social infrastructure. It prioritises quality climate and disaster resilient infrastructure and works with organisations that are committed to enabling women, people with disabilities and other marginalised groups to participate in decision-making to ensure equal access to infrastructure and associated services.</narrative>
  </description>
